 r←GetMainMenu menuItem;items;links
⍝ Returns the main menu as a vector of character vectors.
⍝ `HtmlHeader` puts it on every page, which is what allows the home page to be about the
⍝ Registry rather than a list of links to the rest of it.
⍝ The administrative pages - credential report, usage data, version information - are not
⍝ here but in the footer: they are for whoever runs the server rather than whoever visits it,
⍝ and "robots.txt" keeps crawlers away from them in any case.
⍝ `menuItem` is the path of the item the page being built belongs to, like '/packages'; that
⍝ item is marked as the current one. '' marks none.
⍝ The links are written twice: as a plain row for wide screens and inside a <details> element
⍝ for phones. That needs no JavaScript and cannot get stuck open; the stylesheet shows one or
⍝ the other.
 items←''
 items,←⊂'/packages' 'Packages'
 items,←⊂'/deprecated-pkgs' 'Deprecated'
 items,←⊂'/groups' 'Groups'
 items,←⊂'/tags' 'Tags'
 :If G.INI.Exist'LICENSE:names'
 :AndIf 0<≢⊃G.INI.Get'LICENSE:names'
     items,←⊂'/get-licenses' 'Licensing'
 :EndIf
 links←{
     (path caption)←⍵
     current←path≡menuItem
     '<li><a href="',Reg.VersionOf_REST,path,'"',(current/' aria-current="page"'),'>',caption,'</a></li>'
 }¨items
 links,←⊂'<li><a href="https://aplteam.github.io/Tatin/">Documentation</a></li>'
 r←⊂'<nav id="main-menu" aria-label="Main menu">'
 r,←⊂'<ul class="menu-wide">'
 r,←links
 r,←⊂'</ul>'
 r,←⊂'<details class="menu-narrow">'
 r,←⊂'<summary>Menu</summary>'
 r,←⊂'<ul>'
 r,←links
 r,←⊂'</ul>'
 r,←⊂'</details>'
 r,←⊂'</nav>'
⍝Done
